     FW-C08 as written: "Boot low; assert on the bridge's request when the pack reads below 0 C and clear above 3 C, or when the operator sets "no charge"" (RECORD, HW-FW-CONTRACT)
     FW-A14 as written: "Held low (charger enabled) at power-up; asserted only by firmware" (RECORD); PANEL.md 10: "high = the shore and vehicle inputs are held off at the front end, so nothing charges." (RECORD)
